10. Considering all aspects, the interim order dated 16.11.2023 is hereby made absolute under the conditions that;
(i) the petitioner shall not go anywhere near the vicinity of the victim,
(ii) the petitioner shall not exercise threats to the victim or send messages, and (iii) the petitioner shall not try to influence the witnesses.

